  "description": "Add timeless elegance and fresh botanical beauty to your creative projects with this Blue Hydrangea Seamless Pattern Bundle. This stunning collection features delicate watercolor hydrangea blooms, vintage-inspired floral arrangements, soft botanical vines, romantic striped patterns, and charming cottage garden elements in beautiful shades of sky blue, powder blue, sage green, and soft white.\nPerfect for cottagecore, French country, shabby chic, and vintage botanical designs, these seamless patterns are ideal for fabric design, scrapbooking, invitations, stationery, wallpaper, wrapping paper, packaging, sublimation, and countless digital and print projects.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 23 Individual JPEG Files\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeating Patterns\n➤ Commercial Use Friendly\nFeatures\n➤ Elegant watercolor blue hydrangea illustrations\n➤ Soft blue, white, and botanical green palette\n➤ Cottagecore and French country floral aesthetic\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns\n➤ High-quality digital papers\n➤ Perfect for fabric, scrapbooking, stationery, invitations, wallpaper, wrapping paper, packaging, and sublimation\n➤ Instant digital download\n➤ Suitable for personal and commercial projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add timeless elegance and fresh botanical beauty to your creative projects with this Blue Hydrangea Seamless Pattern Bundle. This stunning collection features delicate watercolor hydrangea blooms, vintage-inspired floral arrangements, soft botanical vines, romantic striped patterns, and charming cottage garden elements in beautiful shades of sky blue, powder blue, sage green, and soft white.</p>\n<p>Perfect for cottagecore, French country, shabby chic, and vintage botanical designs, these seamless patterns are ideal for fabric design, scrapbooking, invitations, stationery, wallpaper, wrapping paper, packaging, sublimation, and countless digital and print projects.</p>\n<p>You Will Receive</p>\n<p>➤ 23 Individual JPEG Files<br>\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches<br>\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution<br>\n➤ Seamless Repeating Patterns<br>\n➤ Commercial Use Friendly</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<p>➤ Elegant watercolor blue hydrangea illustrations<br>\n➤ Soft blue, white, and botanical green palette<br>\n➤ Cottagecore and French country floral aesthetic<br>\n➤ Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n➤ High-quality digital papers<br>\n➤ Perfect for fabric, scrapbooking, stationery, invitations, wallpaper, wrapping paper, packaging, and sublimation<br>\n➤ Instant digital download<br>\n➤ Suitable for personal and commercial projects</p>",
